{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf56 Cook. Eat. Conquer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just a pirate, <strong>you\u2019re a culinary marauder</strong>. In <i>Pirates &amp; Pirater</i>, every battle begins in the kitchen. <strong>Craft</strong> edible weapons, <strong>chow</strong> down on your arsenal, and bring laughter to the high seas in a tongue-in-cheek <strong>Action-Adventure like no other.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/dc07784ee67ec6b1d57d5b0bdaa536ac.avif?t=1755437819\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f What Makes It Different?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget cutlasses of steel, your cutlass might be made of crayfish. Your pistol? A lime. <strong>Every weapon you create can be eaten</strong> for strange buffs, leaving you to decide whether to fight with your masterpiece\u2026 <strong>or snack on it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.poster.avif?t=1755437819\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.webm?t=1755437819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.mp4?t=1755437819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf73 Cook Your Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix <strong>ingredients</strong> into ridiculous weapon recipes. From banana blades to mushroom cannons, every dish has <strong>unique stats, effects, and flavor.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf55 Pirate Comedy Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a ridiculous story across <strong>Gustav\u2019s Archipelago</strong> where pirates take their cooking <strong>very seriously.</strong> Expect slapstick <strong>encounters</strong>, absurd <strong>dialogue</strong>, and plenty of seafaring <strong>shenanigans</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/9610442e273d5ad20ec06a4c67f27ad1.avif?t=1755437819\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Fight with Flavor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every bite matters.</strong> Eating your weapons changes combat strategy, turning meals into power-ups.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Stylized World, Relatable Humor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant, offbeat setting packed with visual gags, silly details, and plenty of Easter eggs for players who love discovering the absurd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.poster.avif?t=1755437819\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.webm?t=1755437819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.mp4?t=1755437819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1 Why You\u2019ll Thank the Chef</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve ever wanted an <strong>Action-Adventure</strong> that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously, <i><strong>Pirates &amp; Pirater</strong></i> serves up the perfect recipe: satisfying combat, absurd creativity, and a story that makes you laugh as much as it makes you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2693 Coming Soon to the High Seas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning of the feast. Future updates may expand recipes, add new bosses, and spice up the story with new missions and side quests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlisting now</strong> ensures you don\u2019t miss what\u2019s cooking next!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/16ac881dedb261cbd81602dce0c235e8.avif?t=1755437819\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2727960?t=1755437819","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755437819","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755437819","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755437819","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf56 Cook. Eat. Conquer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just a pirate, <strong>you\u2019re a culinary marauder</strong>. In <i>Pirates &amp; Pirater</i>, every battle begins in the kitchen. <strong>Craft</strong> edible weapons, <strong>chow</strong> down on your arsenal, and bring laughter to the high seas in a tongue-in-cheek <strong>Action-Adventure like no other.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/dc07784ee67ec6b1d57d5b0bdaa536ac.avif?t=1755437819\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f What Makes It Different?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget cutlasses of steel, your cutlass might be made of crayfish. Your pistol? A lime. <strong>Every weapon you create can be eaten</strong> for strange buffs, leaving you to decide whether to fight with your masterpiece\u2026 <strong>or snack on it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.poster.avif?t=1755437819\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.webm?t=1755437819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.mp4?t=1755437819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf73 Cook Your Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix <strong>ingredients</strong> into ridiculous weapon recipes. From banana blades to mushroom cannons, every dish has <strong>unique stats, effects, and flavor.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf55 Pirate Comedy Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a ridiculous story across <strong>Gustav\u2019s Archipelago</strong> where pirates take their cooking <strong>very seriously.</strong> Expect slapstick <strong>encounters</strong>, absurd <strong>dialogue</strong>, and plenty of seafaring <strong>shenanigans</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/9610442e273d5ad20ec06a4c67f27ad1.avif?t=1755437819\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Fight with Flavor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every bite matters.</strong> Eating your weapons changes combat strategy, turning meals into power-ups.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Stylized World, Relatable Humor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant, offbeat setting packed with visual gags, silly details, and plenty of Easter eggs for players who love discovering the absurd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.poster.avif?t=1755437819\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.webm?t=1755437819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.mp4?t=1755437819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1 Why You\u2019ll Thank the Chef</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve ever wanted an <strong>Action-Adventure</strong> that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously, <i><strong>Pirates &amp; Pirater</strong></i> serves up the perfec